	"description": [
		"This course extends and generalizes methods introduced in SDS 272 by introducing generalized linear models (GLMs) and correlated data methods. GLMs cover logistic and Poisson regression, and more. Correlated data methods include longitudinal data analysis and multi level models. Applications are drawn from across the disciplines. Offered annually. Prerequisite: SDS 272."
